UID:0b19beb13d739c40269732cf194d1855@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:CanopyBloomington will show The Lorax in Butler Park on Saturd
 ay\, October 24th in celebration of the city-declared Canopy Day! With a m
 essage about caring for our environment and speaking up for the places we 
 love\, The Lorax is a great way for families and community members of all 
 ages to close out CanopyDay together. We will also have food trucks\, game
 s\, a tree raffle\, and a volunteer shout out to appreciate all of the wor
 k our volunteers have done with our organization.\n5:30 p.m. — Food\, ga
 mes & festivities begin\n6:30 p.m. — Remarks\, community shoutouts & tre
 e raffle\n7:00 p.m. — Settle in for The Lorax\nFor more information and 
 to let us know you can come to the celebration\, visit: https://www.canopy
 bloomington.org/
GEO:39.1706232;-86.54262109999999
LOCATION:Rev. Ernest D. Butler Park\, 812 W 9th St\, Bloomington\, IN 4740
 4
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/canopy-day-movie-in-the-park/59
 903/
