BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harmony's Hallowganza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T190000
UID:33459ef053c5db5549d8948ddf170f64@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:ABOUT HALLOWGANZA\nGet ready for a spooky new twist on a neigh
 borhood tradition! We are thrilled to announce Hallowganza\, our newly reb
 randed fall festival. We have transformed our classic annual Extravaganza
 \, into the ultimate family-friendly Halloween celebration. Bring the whol
 e family for an afternoon filled with carnival games\, pumpkin painting\, 
 and treats\, with a spooky flair!\nJoin us on Saturday\, October 24th\, fr
 om 3:00 PM to 7:00 PM at Harmony! Entry is $5 a person and is open to the 
 community.\nWHAT TO EXPECT\nEntry is $5 a person and includes 6 activity t
 ickets. You can use these tickets to participate in a variety of activitie
 s and scares. Please note that different activities require a varying numb
 er of tickets to play. Extra tickets will be available to purchase at the 
 welcome/ticket booth for $1/ticket!\nHere is a sneak peak at some of the f
 amily-friendly activities available:\nPumpkin Painting\nTreasure-Haunt\nSc
 ary Stories\n& more!\nAll proceeds go to Harmony School! Join us for a fan
 g-tastic time!\nQUESTIONS?\nIf you have any questions\, contact us at info
 @harmonyschool.org or 812.334.8349
GEO:39.1615898;-86.5216409
LOCATION:Harmony School\, 909 E Second St\, Bloomington\, IN 47401
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/harmonys-hallowganza/60070/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
