DESCRIPTION:Fall is in the air! Join us for a fun run through the fields o
 f The Goat Conspiracy Sanctuary. Our second annual HAYRAISER 5k gives you 
 the chance to get out in nature\, meet our amazing goat and chicken reside
 nts\, and help us fundraise for winter. \nCome out for a fun run/walk or r
 un the course twice for a full 5K.\nThe trail is 'off-road' through our 46
 -acre property in Brown County.\n- Check-in and gates open at 9:00 am\n- R
 ace starts at 10:00 am\n- Includes self-guided visits with the goats and c
 hickens\n- Registration $20\, Kids 12 and under $10 (kids 2 and under are 
 free)\nThe PLANTED Bloomington food truck will be on site selling deliciou
 s plant-based fare from 10am-1pm.\nContact info@thegoatconspiracy.org if y
 ou have any questions!\nPavilion race start/end location\, parking\, and P
 lanted food truck location are wheelchair accessible. The race course goes
  through the pastures and is not wheelchair accessible.
