 itches—the Sanderson Sisters portrayed by Bette Midler\, Sarah Jessica P
 arker\, and Kathy Najimy—return from 17th-century Salem after they're ac
 cidentally conjured up by some unsuspecting pranksters. The 300-year-old t
 rio set out to terrorize the town\, but first they must get their act toge
 ther and outwit three kids and a talking cat! Co-starring Doug Jones\, who
