BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:JTB FALL FREILECH -  Celebration of Jewish Songwriters of Our Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T203000
UID:57116604b41a572272d62dec2ebb2767@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:FALL FREILECH *\nCelebration of Jewish Songwriters of Our Time
  \n*Yiddish: (pronounced "freylekh") A joyous occasion\nFeaturing Sylvia M
 cNair\, Jenn Cristy\, Amy Jackson\, Lara Weaver\, Minka Wiltz\, Quarryland
  Men’s Chorus\, Unitarian Universalist Church Choir and more!\nPerformin
 g the music of Leonard Cohen\, Neil Diamond\, Bob Dylan\, Debbie Friedman
 \, Billy Joel\, Carole King\, Paul Simon\, Stephen Sondheim and more\nMusi
 c Director KIM CARBALLO\nNOT TO BE MISSED performance of Bloomington's bes
 t vocalists and choirs!\nMade possible with the support from City of Bloom
