 Explorers Grand Slam.\nEvery ticket and sponsorship helps complete Beyond 
 Vision\, the feature documentary chronicling his journey from losing his s
 ight in 1997 to conquering all seven summits.\nJoin us for cocktails\, din
 ner\, a filmmaker panel\, a silent auction\, and an exclusive first look a
 t scenes from the film\, all in celebration of a story that proves no summ
 it is out of reach.
