DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T180000
UID:6996033bf94cdd249170fc12cb0dcc6c@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Ring in the New Year the WonderLab way — with an early count
 down made just for kids!\nGet ready to glow. Explore all things that shine
 \, sparkle\, and light up\, and uncover the science behind the shine. Let 
 the kids get their wiggles out with dancing\, games\, and a countdown of t
 heir very own — so by the time the ball drops for the grown-ups\, they'r
 e happily worn out and ready for bed.
GEO:39.1659151;-86.5366351
LOCATION:WonderLab Museum\, 308 W. 4th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/wonderlab-new-years-eve/59830/
