SUMMARY:One Time Pottery Wheel Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270116T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270116T140000
UID:ac49a0aa9490cefbc76386aa0724d944@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Open to all ages. No experience necessary. Learn basic steps o
 f centering and throwing on the wheel. Class lasts 1 1/2 hours and include
 s instruction\, materials and use of tools for $50. Bisque and glaze firin
 g is included for one piece and $5 for each piece. A $25 deposit is requir
 ed to reserve spot. 10 wheels available. Pots are usually ready to glaze i
 n 2 weeks.Two separate Saturday sessions are available at 1pm and 3:30pm.
GEO:39.1654211;-86.4942059
LOCATION:Pottery House Studio\, 223 S Pete Ellis Dr\, Williamsburg Center
 \, Suite 13\, Bloomington\, IN 47408
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/one-time-pottery-wheel-session/
 57303/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
